      ],
      "required_behavior": "Separate readable evidence, active evidence, authenticated provenance, action authority and witness availability for future stages. Prior disclosure must not silently confer spending authority or guarantee a continuation remains executable.",
      "positive_witness": "A disclosed issuer-authenticated document supports a permitted predicate; a separately authorized callback consumes its bound continuation once.",
